Package: fcmspro
Version: 1.6.9
Section: office
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Roderic Villena <villenaderic@gmail.com>
Description: FCMS Pro - Freelance Commission Management System
 Cross-platform desktop app for managing freelance commissions, clients,
 invoices, quotes, payments, and receipts. All data is stored locally in
 a SQLite database - no cloud sync, no external server dependency.
Depends: libicu-dev
